OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEd Sheeran says it was 'not my
OL,4,Adecision' to drop Macklemore from tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his statement, Sheeran said he had
OL,7,Fspoken with the venues "at length all
OL,8,Fweek to try and build a bridge" - but
OL,9,Fthe promoters, Messina Touring Group,
OL,10,Fhad ultimately decided to remove
OL,11,FMacklemore from the bill.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
