OL,3,AHome Alone and Schitt's Creek stars pay
OL,4,Atribute to late Catherine O'Hara
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacaulay Culkin, Annie Murphy and Dan
OL,7,FLevy delivered a poignant tribute to
OL,8,Ftheir late Home Alone and Schitt's
OL,9,FCreek co-star Catherine O'Hara, at
OL,10,FMonday's Emmy Awards in Los Angeles.
OL,12,FCulkin remembered her as "our mom", and
OL,13,F"like a good mom, she always showed up
OL,14,Fwhen I asked her to".
OL,16,FUS singer-songwriter Noah Kahan
OL,17,Fperformed Bridge Over Troubled Water
OL,18,Fduring the in memoriam segment on the
OL,19,Fnight, before Jamie Lee Curtis paid an
OL,20,Femotional tribute to the late actor and
OL,21,Fdirector Rob Reiner.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
